Ostiole: firewall and router appliance manager for Linux nftables.

After installing the package run, as root:

    ostiole install

That writes the systemd units, starts the web UI on https://<host>/, and
explains the next steps (admin account, setup wizard, takeover).
Updates for package installs come from your package manager; the built-in
updater is for tarball installs in /usr/local/bin.
